{"id":"58c74e9d605c12da","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle.md","title":"Protocol Transcripts Partition into Rectangles","display":"lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle — Protocol Transcripts Partition into Rectangles","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle","aliases":["28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle"],"display":"lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle — Protocol Transcripts Partition into Rectangles","depends_on":["[[28-df-communication-protocol]]","[[28-df-communication-matrix]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §13.2.2 and first inequality of Theorem 13.8","source_printed_pages":"273–274","source_pdf_pages":"299–300","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle — Protocol Transcripts Partition into Rectangles"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35827b4b6670766d\" href=\"?note=35827b4b6670766d\" title=\"28-df-communication-protocol\">28-df-communication-protocol</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"05ae51253c88d36f\" href=\"?note=05ae51253c88d36f\" title=\"28-df-communication-matrix\">28-df-communication-matrix</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §13.2.2 and first inequality of Theorem 13.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"273–274"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"299–300"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,(A_h),(B_h))\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y)\">\\(\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,(A_h),(B_h))\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35827b4b6670766d\" href=\"?note=35827b4b6670766d\" title=\"28-df-communication-protocol\">28-df-communication-protocol</a>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\;\\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)=f(x,y)\">\\(\\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\;\\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)=f(x,y)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_\\Pi(x,y)\">\\(h_\\Pi(x,y)\\)</span> 为该定义递归得到的终止历史；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=\\max_{x,y}\\operatorname{cost}_\\Pi(x,y)\">\\(c=\\max_{x,y}\\operatorname{cost}_\\Pi(x,y)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(f)\">\\(\\chi(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"05ae51253c88d36f\" href=\"?note=05ae51253c88d36f\" title=\"28-df-communication-matrix\">28-df-communication-matrix</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq(\\Pi(x,y))_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq(\\Pi(x,y))_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_h\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in X\\times Y:h_\\Pi(x,y)=h\\}\\qquad(h\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_h\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in X\\times Y:h_\\Pi(x,y)=h\\}\\qquad(h\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)\\ \\exists A\\subseteq X\\ \\exists B\\subseteq Y\\quad R_h=A\\times B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)\\ \\exists A\\subseteq X\\ \\exists B\\subseteq Y\\quad R_h=A\\times B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi(f)\\le|\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T):R_h\\ne\\varnothing\\}|\\le2^c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi(f)\\le|\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T):R_h\\ne\\varnothing\\}|\\le2^c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>根历史对应X×Y。Alice发位仅切分X侧，Bob发位仅切分Y侧，因此沿历史归纳保持矩形。叶的最后输出位固定，非空叶矩形单色且分割输入集。只保留可达深度至多c的叶，二叉树至多2^c叶，给第二界。</p>\n<p>来源：§13.2.2 and first inequality of Theorem 13.8；印刷页 273–274；PDF 页 299–300。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第13章的 Protocol Transcripts Partition into Rectangles，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-communication-protocol","status":"resolved","id":"35827b4b6670766d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-communication-protocol]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-communication-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"05ae51253c88d36f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-communication-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-communication-protocol","status":"resolved","id":"35827b4b6670766d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y$ 有限非空，$f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,(A_h),(B_h))\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y)$ 见 [[28-df-communication-protocol]]，且 $\\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\;\\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)=f(x,y)$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-communication-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"05ae51253c88d36f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$h_\\Pi(x,y)$ 为该定义递归得到的终止历史；$c=\\max_{x,y}\\operatorname{cost}_\\Pi(x,y)$；$\\chi(f)$ 见 [[28-df-communication-matrix]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,(A_h),(B_h))\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\;\\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)=f(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"h_\\Pi(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"c=\\max_{x,y}\\operatorname{cost}_\\Pi(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi(f)","display":false},{"tex":"h_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq(\\Pi(x,y))_1.","display":true},{"tex":"R_h\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in X\\times Y:h_\\Pi(x,y)=h\\}\\qquad(h\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)\\ \\exists A\\subseteq X\\ \\exists B\\subseteq Y\\quad R_h=A\\times B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi(f)\\le|\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T):R_h\\ne\\varnothing\\}|\\le2^c.","display":true}],"bytes":2125,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-341","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-communication-matrix]]、[[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]、[[28-thm-communication-rank-lower-bound]]、[[28-df-discrepancy]]、[[28-thm-discrepancy-communication-bound]]、[[28-df-number-on-forehead]]。"},{"id":"8bc80ccb6d4290e0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M_f,\\chi(f)$ 见 [[28-df-communication-matrix]]；$D(f)$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]；协议矩形结论见 [[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]]。"},{"id":"b74fca4eda5da9e2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Disc}_\\mu$ 见 [[28-df-discrepancy]]；$\\chi(f)$ 见 [[28-df-communication-matrix]]；$D(f)$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]；[[28-lem-protocol-leaf-rectangle]] 给协议分割界。"}],"outgoing":["35827b4b6670766d","05ae51253c88d36f"]}